      "mergeID": "62fb49c2a5bc7944b435171d",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The camera has a tab in the Quick Menu to pull it out. You can double-click the tab to instantly pull it out.\nIt would be more convenient to make the personal mirror a Quick Menu tab, so it's not hiding in the Action Menu.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1220] [FEEDBACK] Give the personal mirror its own QM tab",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "62f46e68d87d001400564b99",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 1
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't really think an extra Tab is needed for it. It would add a bit of bluk to the QM which should / could be used later on for Udon Hooks.\nThe Action Menu placement im comparision allows you to controll it while walking and with only one hand, both are not possible if it would be in the QM. The thing they should consider though is moving it to the first page of the Action Menu, so it's a bit faster to get to it.\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1216-move-portable-mirror-to-the-first-page-of-the-action-menu",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
